              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Can a 6500 watt generator run a house?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                It can run the essentials of most houses through a transfer switch or interlock: refrigerator, freezer, furnace blower, sump pump, lights and outlets. A true 6,500 running-watt model like the Generac GP6500 can also start a typical well pump. It cannot run central air, an electric range, an electric water heater or an electric dryer alongside the essentials.
              </p>
